this temporary solution in the form of a tui plugin helped me to hide the logo completely

tested on windows 11 and xubuntu
In theory, it should work on any OS

## Plugin
~/.config/opencode/plugins/no-logo-egg.tsx
```tsx
/** @jsxImportSource @opentui/solid */
import type { TuiPlugin, TuiPluginModule } from "@opencode-ai/plugin/tui"

const tui: TuiPlugin = async (api) => {
  api.slots.register({
    order: 0,
    slots: {
      home_logo() {
        return <box />
      },
    },
  })
}

const plugin: TuiPluginModule & { id: string } = {
  id: "my.no-logo-egg",
  tui,
}

export default plugin
```

## Config
~/.config/opencode/tui.json
```json
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/tui.json",
  "plugin": ["./plugins/no-logo-egg"]
}
```
